{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And that you may tell.</b> He speaks to Moses, who stands for all Israel. So too \"and you shall know that I am YHWH\" — that all Israel should know this. And the Torah speaks in human language, saying \"I made sport,\" like a person who changes the order of things to take vengeance against another."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:04.729752067Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}